{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id134762866"}, "name":{"label":"adzsphecky"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-12-10T15:36:15-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.2.2"}, "id":{"label":"9382672802"}, "title":{"label":"I love it!! But for intentional tracking…"}, "content":{"label":"This app has been super helpful and really creates a stop on times where I find myself mindlessly opening apps. The intentional tracking feature is genius, but I would love it if you implemented system that prevents you from continuing with the app if you haven’t typed up an intention - for example, I’d get prompted to type what intention for the app is, but I’d tap the “continue” button without typing anything. So it’d be super helpful to have the “continue” button greyed out until you’ve typed out your intention.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
