{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id629771478"}, "name":{"label":"lilly is a loooooser"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-08-09T01:11:22-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.4"}, "id":{"label":"8960276585"}, "title":{"label":"Gave me genuine results"}, "content":{"label":"I seriously cannot recommend this app enough when it comes to habit breaking. I have depression and have been using this app to help me snap out of my ‘addiction’ to a certain clock app, and it has helped me so so so much. It turns a passive habit into an active decision and gives me the actual choice to stop scrolling. Highly recommend adding this to your toolkit if you have depression or even if you’re just trying to diminish the amount of time you spend on a particular app that takes up too much of your time. props!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
